00:06:22.399 --> 00:06:24.399
And one claim is worth 1 crore

00:06:24.399 --> 00:06:26.399
So the company will pass 99 claims worth 1 lakh

00:06:26.399 --> 00:06:28.379
But the claim worth 1 crore

00:06:28.399 --> 00:06:30.399
Which is a big claim

00:06:30.399 --> 00:06:32.399
Will either delay in passing

00:06:32.399 --> 00:06:34.399
Or may be reject it

00:06:34.399 --> 00:06:36.399
So in this case

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.799
